  "description": "API Holodeck extension for Mostlylucid.BotDetection - honeypot API simulation using LLM-powered mock responses. Includes: HolodeckActionPolicy (redirect bots to fake APIs), HoneypotContributor (detect honeypot link followers), and Project Honeypot data submission.",
